      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The society sponsors lectures, workshops, and walking tours each year, keeping Live Oak’s history alive for residents and visitors alike.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4,
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://museumsdatabase.com/museums/view/3925",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Its museum houses a vast collection of artifacts, photographs, and documents that illustrate the rich cultural heritage of Sutter County.",
